# COUI blur compatibility module

The sources under `src/main/java/io/github/currencortex/music/blurcompat` are
derived from the COUI `coui-blur` module 2.0.0
(https://github.com/suqi8/coui), licensed under Apache-2.0.

They are vendored as an Android library with `minSdk 26` because the published
`coui-blur-android` artifact declares `minSdk 33`, while CurrentMusic keeps
Android 8 compatibility. The runtime shader paths are gated by
`isRuntimeShaderSupported()` and never execute below Android 13.
